    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>While you play this musical instrument, you can take a Magic action to conjure harmless illusory visual effects within a 5-foot Emanation originating from the instrument, or a 15-foot Emanation if you’re a Bard. Glowing musical notes, a spectral dancer, butterflies, or gently falling snow are a few examples. The effects have no substance and make no sound, they are obviously illusions, and they end when you stop playing.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-GcP2cublC518hrvg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Illusory Display (Bard)</em>, à 15 pieds, n’apparaît que pour un Barde.</p></section>",
